        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Numbers go up. So does the chaos.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sheep Clicker Royale </strong>🐑 is a fast-paced, highly polished clicker game where you defeat increasingly ridiculous sheep to grow your power, unlock bonuses, and chase ultimate wool domination.<br>Upgrade your stats, hunt bizarre sheep, capture them, and repeat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >all carefully balanced to deliver that <i>perfectly satisfying</i> idle loop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🎮 Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧠 <strong>Tons of Upgrades</strong> – Boost your click power, idle gains, and more. Every number matters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🦆 <strong>30+ Sheep to Discover (and Destroy)</strong> – Yes, sheep. No, they’re not friendly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👑 <strong>Master Sheep</strong> – Defeat elite sheep to unlock game-changing bonuses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎯 <strong>Quests &amp; Objectives</strong> – Complete missions to unlock features and earn sweet rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💰 <strong>Idle Income</strong> – Capture and sell sheep to earn passive income.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏆 <strong>Achievements</strong> – Track your progress and show off your sheep-slaying skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔁 <strong>Rebirth System</strong> – Start fresh with powerful new currency and permanent upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💾 <strong>Auto Save</strong> – Never lose your flock. Your progress is safe.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🐑 Why play?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because <i>clicking sheep is more fun than it sounds.</i><br>Whether you’re in it for a quick boost of dopamine or a full-blown wool empire, <strong>Sheep Clicker Royale</strong> offers a funny, addicting, and rewarding idle experience.</p>",
